---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Guided Jungle Trekking in Khao Sok"
  description="Khao Sok trekking promises an extraordinary experience. Enjoy jungle trekking on an exciting Khao Sok hiking tour of the National Park."
  heroImage="/wp-content/uploads/2015/09/IMG_2605-crop.jpg"
  heroTitle="Guided Jungle Trekking in Khao Sok"
  heroSubtitle="Guided Primary Rainforest Trails & Wildlife Walks"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Khao Sok Trekking Hiking", "href": "/khao-sok-trekking-hiking/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] font-medium uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Jungle Hiking in Khao Sok</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Khao Sok National Park offers some of the most rewarding rainforest trekking in Thailand, with jungle trails leading to waterfalls, caves, rivers, towering trees, and hidden areas of ancient rainforest.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          At Riverside Cottages, our hiking experiences are arranged privately with our own local guides rather than as large join-in tours. Whether you are travelling as a couple, family, or group of friends, each trek is tailored to your pace, interests, and level of adventure.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          From relaxed half-day walks and <a href="/khao-sok-family-holiday-thailand/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">family-friendly</a> jungle trails to full-day rainforest trekking, night safaris, cave hikes, and seasonal Rafflesia flower expeditions, our guides help guests experience the rainforest in a more personal and immersive way.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <em>NOTE: Prices shown are per person</em>
        </p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How to plan your stay</span>
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Choose a <a href="/khao-sok-tour-packages/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Package</a> with a set program for best value</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Or click the 'Plan Your Stay' buttons to create your own experiences.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Half Day Jungle Hike</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="my-10 aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#12281b]/15 bg-black">
          <iframe
            class="w-full h-full"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/lidrzbqNuDM?rel=0"
            title="YouTube video player"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="my-10 max-w-[340px] mx-auto rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#12281b]/15 bg-black aspect-[9/16]">
          <iframe
            class="w-full h-full"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/dNdnN0f4-lQ?rel=0"
            title="YouTube video player"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Explore the rainforest trails of Khao Sok National Park on a relaxed half-day jungle hike suitable for couples, families, and anyone wanting to experience the rainforest at a comfortable pace.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The trail passes through dense jungle, towering trees, riverside paths, natural swimming areas, and small waterfalls, with plenty of opportunities to stop, swim, and take in the surroundings. Along the way, our guides help guests notice the smaller details of the rainforest, from unusual plants and giant bamboo to monkeys, butterflies, birds, and the constantly changing sounds of the jungle.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Duration:</strong> 2–4 hours easy to moderate hiking.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Price Per Person:</strong> 700 THB
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <i class="fb-icon-element-1 fb-icon-element fontawesome-icon fa-info fas circle-no fusion-text-flow" style="--awb-iconcolor:var(--awb-color7);--awb-iconcolor-hover:var(--awb-color7);--awb-font-size:20px;--awb-margin-right:10px;"></i>Please remember to bring money for the National Park entrance fee.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok Trekking Full Day Hike</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="my-10 aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#12281b]/15 bg-black">
          <iframe
            class="w-full h-full"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/F6h6--ve1VQ?rel=0"
            title="YouTube video player"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="my-10 max-w-[340px] mx-auto rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#12281b]/15 bg-black aspect-[9/16]">
          <iframe
            class="w-full h-full"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/gQWWp_op6g0?rel=0"
            title="YouTube video player"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Spend a full day trekking deeper into the rainforest of Khao Sok National Park with one of our local guides. These longer hikes allow more time to explore quieter jungle trails, rivers, waterfalls, and remote areas of the forest while learning about the plants, wildlife, and ecology of one of the oldest rainforests in the world.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Depending on conditions and your interests, routes may include river crossings, swimming spots, bamboo groves, limestone landscapes, and more challenging jungle terrain. Wildlife sightings can include monkeys, hornbills, and occasionally gibbons, while lunch is traditionally served in the jungle wrapped in banana leaf.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Duration:</strong> 5–8 hours moderate to challenging hiking.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Price Per Person:</strong> 1,400 THB
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <i class="fb-icon-element-2 fb-icon-element fontawesome-icon fa-info fas circle-no fusion-text-flow" style="--awb-iconcolor:var(--awb-color7);--awb-iconcolor-hover:var(--awb-color7);--awb-font-size:20px;--awb-margin-right:10px;"></i>Please bring swimwear for river and waterfall stops, along with money for the National Park entrance fee.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Interested in something more specialised? Our staff can also help arrange unique hikes such as the hike to the <a href="/khao-sok-jungle-hike/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">hike to the giant bamboo.</a>
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Night Safari</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="my-10 aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#12281b]/15 bg-black">
          <iframe
            class="w-full h-full"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/dNg0P5Qx-Cg?rel=0"
            title="YouTube video player"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="my-10 max-w-[340px] mx-auto rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#12281b]/15 bg-black aspect-[9/16]">
          <iframe
            class="w-full h-full"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Xn0zX0ulTFs?rel=0"
            title="YouTube video player"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          When darkness falls in Khao Sok, the rainforest changes completely. Join one of our local guides on a <a href="/khao-sok-night-safari/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">night safari</a> and experience the sounds, movement, and atmosphere of the jungle after sunset.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Using headlamps and moving quietly along forest trails, guests may encounter nocturnal wildlife such as civets, owls, frogs, bats, insects, and occasionally the tiny mouse deer or slow loris. Just as memorable as the wildlife itself are the sounds of the rainforest at night, with cicadas, frogs, and countless unseen creatures creating the jungle’s nightly orchestra.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Duration:</strong> 1–2 hours walking.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Price Per Person:</strong> 700 THB
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <i class="fb-icon-element-3 fb-icon-element fontawesome-icon fa-info fas circle-no fusion-text-flow" style="--awb-iconcolor:var(--awb-color7);--awb-iconcolor-hover:var(--awb-color7);--awb-font-size:20px;--awb-margin-right:10px;"></i>For the best wildlife experience, we recommend keeping noise and lights to a minimum during the safari.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Jungle Day, Jungle Night</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="my-10 aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#12281b]/15 bg-black">
          <iframe
            class="w-full h-full"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/dp8H0Ic8HRM?rel=0"
            title="YouTube video player"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="my-10 max-w-[340px] mx-auto rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#12281b]/15 bg-black aspect-[9/16]">
          <iframe
            class="w-full h-full"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/tXq9ovhJCQY?rel=0"
            title="YouTube video player"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Experience the rainforest through both daylight and darkness on this extended jungle adventure combining afternoon trekking with a guided night safari.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Begin the afternoon exploring jungle trails, rivers, giant vines, and towering rainforest trees while your guide helps you discover the wildlife and smaller details often missed on shorter walks. There may be opportunities to swim in the river before stopping in the forest for a jungle-style dinner cooked over an open fire using natural bamboo utensils.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          After dark, continue deeper into the changing atmosphere of the rainforest with headlamps as the jungle comes alive with nocturnal sounds and wildlife. Owls, civets, frogs, insects, and mouse deer are sometimes spotted, while the sounds of the rainforest become an important part of the experience itself.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Duration:</strong> 4–6 hours easy to moderate hiking, including a break for dinner.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Price Per Person:</strong> 1,600 THB
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <i class="fb-icon-element-4 fb-icon-element fontawesome-icon fa-info fas circle-no fusion-text-flow" style="--awb-iconcolor:var(--awb-color7);--awb-iconcolor-hover:var(--awb-color7);--awb-font-size:20px;--awb-margin-right:10px;"></i>Please bring 300 Baht for the National Park entrance fee.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Bang Man Cave Hike</span>
        </h2>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2015/09/IMG_2605-crop.jpg"
            alt="Bang Man cave in Khao Sok National Park"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Bang Man cave in Khao Sok National Park</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          This guided rainforest hike combines jungle trekking, cave exploration, and time spent deep inside the rainforest of Khao Sok National Park.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The hike begins along jungle trails beneath towering trees and dense vegetation before stopping beside an open fire for a simple Thai-style lunch served in the forest. After lunch, the trail continues toward Bang Man Cave, where headlamps reveal limestone formations, cave wildlife, and the cool darkness beneath the rainforest.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          After emerging from the cave, the hike continues through hilly jungle terrain before returning from the forest.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Duration:</strong> 5–6 hours of moderately challenging hiking.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Price Per Person:</strong> 1,800 THB for 2 people, 1,500 THB for 3+ people
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <i class="fb-icon-element-5 fb-icon-element fontawesome-icon fa-info fas circle-no fusion-text-flow" style="--awb-iconcolor:var(--awb-color7);--awb-iconcolor-hover:var(--awb-color7);--awb-font-size:20px;--awb-margin-right:10px;"></i>The cave can be quite wet, so wear supportive waterproof shoes or bring water shoes.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          For a more detailed first-hand account of the experience, read our <a href="/khao-sok-park/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Bang Man Cave hike blog post</a>.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Rafflesia – Trekking to the Giant Flower (December – March)</span>
        </h2>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2015/09/khao-sok-rafflesia.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok Rafflesia"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok Rafflesia</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Hidden deep within the rainforest, the rare Rafflesia is one of the most remarkable plants found in Khao Sok National Park. Blooming only for a short period each year, these enormous flowers can reach over one metre in diameter and are among the largest flowers in the world.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Finding a blooming Rafflesia depends entirely on seasonal conditions and up-to-date local knowledge of where flowers have recently opened. Guided hikes lead into steep rainforest terrain where guests may have the opportunity to see this unusual and short-lived natural phenomenon in its jungle environment.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Because flowering periods are unpredictable and blooms last only a few days, these hikes are arranged directly with our staff rather than through the normal activities booking system. During the flowering season, please <a href="/contact-khao-sok-riverside-cottages/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">contact us</a> directly to check whether active blooms have recently been located and to arrange a guided hike.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Duration:</strong> 2–4 hours strenuous hiking with steep and uneven terrain.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Contact us for price</strong>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <i class="fb-icon-element-6 fb-icon-element fontawesome-icon fa-info fas circle-no fusion-text-flow" style="--awb-iconcolor:var(--awb-color7);--awb-iconcolor-hover:var(--awb-color7);--awb-font-size:20px;--awb-margin-right:10px;"></i>This hike is recommended for guests comfortable hiking on steep rainforest trails.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          For a more detailed look at the experience, read our <a href="/thailand-jungle-trekking/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Rafflesia hike blog post</a>, and learn more about the rare<a href="https://www.kew.org/plants/rafflesia-arnoldi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Rafflesia flower</a>.
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/packages-call-to-action.jpg"
            alt="Enjoying Khao Sok lake"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Enjoying Khao Sok lake</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          For the most popular activities<br /> and the best value
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Please visit our packages page.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          For the most popular activities<br /> and the best value
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Please visit our packages page.
        </p>
        <div class="my-12">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
            <figure class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50 group">
              <img
